44:13 ) followed by accusative e.g. land Gen 47:20 , 22 (J), Lev 25:14 (accusative of congnate meaning with verb), 25:25 (H; followed by מֵאֲחֻזָּתוֺ ) compare Ezek 48:14 (followed by מִן partitive), Lev 25:15 (no object expressed), so 25:27 ; 27:20 (H), Ruth 4:3 ; house Lev 25:29 (H); beast Exod 21:35 ; Exodus 21:37 (E); flesh Deut 14:21 (no object); crop Lev 25:16 (H); food Neh 10:32 ; 13:15-16 , compare 13:20 (followed by מִמְכָר ); oil 2Kin 4:7 ; linen Prov 31:24 ; birthright Gen 25:31 , 33 (J); most often human beings, e.g. as slaves 37:27-28 , 36 ; 45:4-5 , (all J E), Exod 21:16 (E), Deut 21:14 (twice in verse); 24:7 , compare Amos 2:6 ; Neh 5:8 ; Zech 11:5 ; Joel 4:3; Joel 4:6; Joel 4:7; Joel 4:8 (twice in verse); especially daughters Exod 21:7-8 , (E); in marriage Gen 31:15 (E); Participle = seller Isa 24:2 ; Ezek 7:12-13 , figurative, object truth Prov 23:23 ; of Nineveh, selling nations גּוֺיִם Nahum 3:4 ; especially ׳י selling his people (to enemies), i.e. giving it entirely into their power: Deut 32:30 ; Psa 44:13 ; Isa 50:1 , also ( ׳מ בְּיַד ) Judg 2:14 ; 3:8 ; 4:2 ; 10:7 ; 1Sam 12:9 ; compare Judg 4:9 (Sisera to woman); also Ezek 30:12 (strike out Co after B and others) Niph`al Perfect נִמְכַּר Lev 25:48 5 t., etc.; Imperfect יִמָּכֵר 25:34 3 t., etc.; Infinitive הִמָּֽכְרוֺ 25:50 ; Participle plural נִמְכָּרִים Neh 5:8 ; &#8212; be sold , of land Lev 25:23 , 34 ; beast 27:27 ; compare 27:28 (all P); of human beings as slaves Exod 22:2 for ( בְּ ) theft (E), Lev 25:42 (P), Psa 105:17 ; Est 7:4 ; sell oneself Lev 25:39 , 47 , 48 , 50 (PH), Deut 15:12 ; Jer 34:14 ; Neh 5:8 (twice in verse); figurative of Israel, sold by ׳י , Isa 50:1 for ( בְּ ) their sins, 52:3 ; compare Est 7:4 = given over to death. Hithpa`el Perfect הִתְמַכֵּר 1Kin 21:25 ; וְהִתְמַכַּרְתֶּם consecutive Deut 28:68 ; וַיִּתְמַכְּרוּ 2Kin 17:17 ; Infinitive הִתְמַכֶּרְךָ 1Kin 21:20 ; sell oneself as slave Deut 28:68 ; figurative 1Kin 21:20 , 25 ; 2Kin 17:17 , all followed by הָרַע לַעֲ